# The demo-authoring template: a local copy of crypto-lab/audits/_MASTER-TEMPLATE.md,
# deliberately NOT tracked. A committed copy inside a lab ages silently and becomes a
# second, wrong standard — one was deleted from the catalog root on 2026-08-20 still
# claiming to be the single source of truth while carrying no dependency automation
# and three outdated action pins. Re-copy it when you need a fresh one.
CRYPTO-LAB-TEMPLATE*.md

node_modules
dist
.DS_Store
*.local
playwright-report
test-results

# Review and working notes. Kept on disk, never committed -- they are a snapshot
# of one conversation, and a committed one ages into a second, wrong account of
# what the lab does. The fleet convention: sibling labs ignore chat*.md.
chat*.md
